Koi second scanner, second resume engine ya second evidence registry nahi.

7. Automatic New-Chat Session Pack
Ye addition tumhari original problem ko directly solve karega.

Nayi chat shuru hote hi poora repository ya hazaaron lines ke documents context mein daalne ki jagah Atlas se ek compact session pack generate hoga.

Usmein sirf:

Current branch aur exact HEAD.

Live task aur subtask.

Current authoritative work plan.

Relevant file ownership.

Previous completed work.

Current unresolved work.

Last verified CI result.

Known failure ka root cause.

Kya evidence stale hua.

Next permitted implementation step.

Kaunsi exact files read karni hain.

Isse har chat mein hum zero se project research shuru nahi karenge.

Aur session pack Atlas ka generated section hoga, teesri independent reference file nahi.

8. CI Failure Memory — same error par same investigation dobara nahi
Har failure ko unique identity mile:

workflow + run + attempt + commit SHA + job + failed step + failure signature

Phir system compare kare:

Kya failure pehle aa chuka hai?

Kya exact source SHA same hai?

Kya error signature same hai?

Kya previous root cause verified tha?

Kya uske baad relevant code change hua?

Agar same failure hai, toh previous verified diagnosis reuse hoga. Agar actual code ya error badla hai, tab targeted investigation hogi.

Important: Old failure ka fix current failure par bina verification apply nahi hoga.

9. Security, Integrity and Recovery
Atlas bhi ek generated data artifact hai, authority source nahi. Isliye uska misuse ya stale version accept nahi hona chahiye.

Main ye checks rakhta:

Generator sirf read-only repository inspection kare.

Repository files ko execute na kare.

File paths aur symlinks validate hon.

Secret values kabhi Atlas mein na aayen.

Workflow permissions minimum read-only hon.

JSON schema aur fingerprint validate hon.

Artifact ka exact source SHA verify ho.

Missing ya invalid artifact par historical version ko current mark na kiya jaaye.

Generator failure aur backend test failure ko alag report kiya jaaye.

10. Enforced Rules — documentation likhne se rule enforce nahi hota
Ye sabse bada engineering principle hai.

Sirf EntryPoint mein likh dena kaafi nahi ki duplicate files nahi banani, complete replacement dena hai, ya state change verify karna hai.

Un important rules ko automated contract tests se enforce karna hoga.

Examples:

Existing owner ke hote duplicate owner create na ho.

Task authority state.json ke against na chale.

Incorrect SHA wala evidence current na maana jaaye.

Atlas mein duplicate file records na hon.

Required tracked files inventory se miss na hon.

Failed CI ko PASS evidence mein convert na kiya ja sake.

Guarded transition ke bina task DONE mark na ho.

Backend-only changes se frontend files unnecessarily modify na hon.

Ek aur important baat: external changes
Kuch changes GitHub repository mein commit nahi hote. Jaise GitHub Secrets, branch protection, environment approvals, external API configuration aur live database schema.

Atlas inki presence aur verification metadata record kar sakta hai, lekin unhe repository scan se discover karne ka jhootha claim nahi karna chahiye.

Jis task ko unki zaroorat ho, usi samay relevant live verification honi chahiye. Secret values kabhi copy nahi honi chahiye.

