Ek important boundary: Atlas banne ke baad bhi B4 ka live status state.json se hi aayega; Atlas kabhi B4 acceptance criteria ya task authority replace nahi karega.

Mera target hai: ek baar verified research ko baar-baar na karna, ek baar fix hui problem ko bina naye evidence ke dobara na kholna, aur repository mein koi relevant change ho toh uska impact automatically trace karna. यही HOMIO / REOS ke liye professional engineering standard hona chahiye.

